ailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Main2440v3.png", "id": "1341012711343178", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_1341012718009844_6447400968154278584_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Si1h_CZUM5cQ7kNvwF0gNP8&_nc_oc=AdpBrT17QrKegOghZlFE7fv3gkl0_PEUnRDI5xLVQzuioYgFHS-ZDpgXuzTXQgJ5adY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBehlzE5M4X3WBe9p59HmstOH7j92VUSwVufIgZ6VzAFg&oe=6A6F280C"}, "display_name": "COSMOS", "keywords": ["space", "universe", "science", "astronomy", "exploration"], "long_description": "\nCOSMOS \u2014 A light and sound journey into the universe.\n\nStep into a poetic and immersive virtual reality experience created by Mirage Makers. After receiving a strange signal from outer space, you will be taken into the cosmos.\n\n- Immersive experience with interactions.\n- Talented Voice-Over actors.\n- A 100% original poetic journey.\n\nMade by Mirage Makers, a french studio building immersive experience in Europe.", "short_description": "COSMOS \u2014 A light and sound journey into the universe.\n(voices in English / Voix fran\u00e7aise)\n\nStep into a poetic and immersive virtual reality experience created by Mirage Makers. After receiving a strange signal from outer space, you will be taken into the cosmos.\n\n- Immersive experience with interactions and choices\n- Talented Voice-Over actors.\n- A 100% original poetic journey.\n\nEnglish and French languages available at launch.\nSpanish and German languages soon.\nSubtitles in DE/CN/KR/JP/ES"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1458126942814791", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "COSMOS", "keywords": ["Weltraum", "Erkundung", "Wissenschaft", "Universum"], "long_description": "COSMOS \u2014 Eine Reise aus Licht und Klang in das Universum.\n(Englische Sprachausgabe / Franz\u00f6sische Sprachausgabe)\nUntertitel in DE / CN / KR / JP / ES\n\nTreten Sie ein in ein poetisches und immersives Virtual-Reality-Erlebnis, erschaffen von Mirage Makers. Nach dem Empfang eines mysteri\u00f6sen Signals aus dem Weltall werden Sie direkt in den Kosmos entf\u00fchrt.\n\n- Immersives Erlebnis mit Interaktionen und Entscheidungen\n- Talentierte Synchronsprecher\n- Eine zu 100 % originelle poetische Reise", "short_description": "COSMOS \u2014 Eine Reise aus Licht und Klang in das Universum.\n(Englische Sprachausgabe / Franz\u00f6sische Sprachausgabe)\nUntertitel in DE / CN / KR / JP / ES\n\nTreten Sie ein in ein poetisches und immersives Virtual-Reality-Erlebnis, erschaffen von Mirage Makers. Nach dem Empfang eines mysteri\u00f6sen Signals aus dem Weltall werden Sie direkt in den Kosmos entf\u00fchrt.\n\n- Immersives Erlebnis mit Interaktionen und Entscheidungen\n- Talentierte Synchronsprecher\n- Eine zu 100 % originelle poetische Reise\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1376110537734825", "locale": "ko_KR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "COSMOS \ucf54\uc2a4\ubaa8\uc2a4", "keywords": ["\uc6b0\uc8fc", "\ud0d0\uc0ac", "\ucc9c\ubb38\ud559", "\uacfc\ud559"], "long_description": "COSMOS \u2014 \uc6b0\uc8fc\ub85c \ub5a0\ub098\ub294 \ube5b\uacfc \uc18c\ub9ac\uc758 \uc5ec\uc815.\n\uff08\uc601\uc5b4 \uc74c\uc131 / \ud504\ub791\uc2a4\uc5b4 \uc74c\uc131\uff09\n\uc790\ub9c9 \uc9c0\uc6d0: \ub3c5\uc5b4 / \uc911\uad6d\uc5b4 / \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 / \uc77c\uc5b4 / \uc2a4\ud398\uc778\uc5b4\n\nMirage Makers\uac00 \ucc3d\uc870\ud55c \uc2dc\uc801\uc774\uace0 \ubab0\uc785\uac10 \ub118\uce58\ub294 \uac00\uc0c1\ud604\uc2e4 \uccb4\ud5d8 \uc18d\uc73c\ub85c \uac78\uc5b4 \ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694. \uc678\uacc4\ub85c\ubd80\ud130 \uc628 \uc758\ubb38\uc758 \uc2e0\ud638\ub97c \uc218\uc2e0\ud55c \ud6c4, \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uad11\ud65c\ud55c \uc6b0\uc8fc \uc18d\uc73c\ub85c \uc778\ub3c4\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc0c1\ud638\uc791\uc6a9\uacfc \uc120\ud0dd\uc774 \uc788\ub294 \ubab0\uc785\ud615 \uacbd\ud5d8\n\n\uc2e4\ub825\ud30c \uc131\uc6b0\uc9c4\uc758 \uc5f4\uc5f0\n\n100% \uc624\ub9ac\uc9c0\ub110 \uc2dc\uc801 \uc5ec\uc815", "short_description": "COSMOS \u2014 \uc6b0\uc8fc\ub85c \ub5a0\ub098\ub294 \ube5b\uacfc \uc18c\ub9ac\uc758 \uc5ec\uc815.\n\uff08\uc601\uc5b4 \uc74c\uc131 / \ud504\ub791\uc2a4\uc5b4 \uc74c\uc131\uff09\n\uc790\ub9c9 \uc9c0\uc6d0: \ub3c5\uc5b4 / \uc911\uad6d\uc5b4 / \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 / \uc77c\uc5b4 / \uc2a4\ud398\uc778\uc5b4\n\nMirage Makers\uac00 \ucc3d\uc870\ud55c \uc2dc\uc801\uc774\uace0 \ubab0\uc785\uac10 \ub118\uce58\ub294 \uac00\uc0c1\ud604\uc2e4 \uccb4\ud5d8 \uc18d\uc73c\ub85c \uac78\uc5b4 \ub4e4\uc5b4\uac00 \ubcf4\uc138\uc694. \uc678\uacc4\ub85c\ubd80\ud130 \uc628 \uc758\ubb38\uc758 \uc2e0\ud638\ub97c \uc218\uc2e0\ud55c \ud6c4, \ub2f9\uc2e0\uc740 \uad11\ud65c\ud55c \uc6b0\uc8fc \uc18d\uc73c\ub85c \uc778\ub3c4\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc0c1\ud638\uc791\uc6a9\uacfc \uc120\ud0dd\uc774 \uc788\ub294 \ubab0\uc785\ud615 \uacbd\ud5d8\n\n\uc2e4\ub825\ud30c \uc131\uc6b0\uc9c4\uc758 \uc5f4\uc5f0\n\n100% \uc624\ub9ac\uc9c0\ub110 \uc2dc\uc801 \uc5ec\uc815"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1190869686560691", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "COSMOS", "keywords": ["espace", "exploration", "astronomie", "voyage", "science"], "long_description": "COSMOS \u2014 Un voyage son et lumi\u00e8re dans le cosmos intergalactique, avec voix fran\u00e7aise !\n\nPlongez dans une exp\u00e9rience de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle po\u00e9tique et immersive cr\u00e9\u00e9e par Mirage Makers (France). Apr\u00e8s avoir re\u00e7u un \u00e9trange signal en provenance de l'espace, vous serez emport\u00e9 au c\u0153ur du cosmos.\n\nVous suivrez Nora Voss, sp\u00e9cialiste en communication et grande scientifique. Elle va devoir partir pour Venus, pour une mission top-secrete. L'histoire est inspire des r\u00e9cits de Carl Sagan.\n\n- Exp\u00e9rience immersive avec interactions et choix\n- Acteurs de doublage de grand talent\n- Un voyage po\u00e9tique 100 % original\n\nLangues anglaise et fran\u00e7aise disponibles au lancement.", "short_description": "COSMOS \u2014 Un voyage son et lumi\u00e8re dans le cosmos intergalactique, avec voix fran\u00e7aise !\n\nPlongez dans une exp\u00e9rience de r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle po\u00e9tique et immersive cr\u00e9\u00e9e par Mirage Makers (France). Apr\u00e8s avoir re\u00e7u un \u00e9trange signal en provenance de l'espace, vous serez emport\u00e9 au c\u0153ur du cosmos.\n\n- Exp\u00e9rience immersive avec interactions et choix\n- Acteurs de doublage de grand talent\n- Un voyage po\u00e9tique 100 % original\n\nLangues anglaise et fran\u00e7aise disponibles au lancement."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.miragemakers.com/cosmosvrpolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mirage Makers", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.miragemakers.com/cosmosvr", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1289555840910111"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313072_1338263451754397_4796273836909153428_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IwCFzsz0aJ0Q7kNvwGtuG-E&_nc_oc=AdpL3gox3NiIDOWT2sqXHhvJ4ZLh